      "message": "chore(release): v0.7.0 (#183)\n\nEleven commits since v0.6.1: three feat, four fix, no breaking changes.\n\nThe README's version examples move in the same commit. It doubles as the\nMarketplace listing body, so leaving them at 0.6.1 would advertise a\nsuperseded release to anyone copy-pasting from the listing \u2014 the defect\nrecorded as #165. marketplace-check enforces it. The v0.6.0/v0.5.0 refs\ninside blockquotes are deliberately historical and stay.\n\n\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5\nSigned-off-by: Ronny Trommer <ronny@no42.org>",
