        "message": "ci(deps): bump github/codeql-action from 4.37.2 to 4.37.3 as one pair (#198)\n\nDependabot bumped init and analyze in separate PRs (#191, #192); each\nleaves the two steps on different versions and CodeQL fails with a\nconfiguration error. Bump both pins together and add a Dependabot\ngroup so future codeql-action updates arrive as a single PR.\n\nCloses #197\n\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-fable-5\n\nSigned-off-by: Ronny Trommer <ronny@no42.org>",
